&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Original:&lt;/strong&gt; Quality of drinking water varies significantly by airline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46439769"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HN Discussion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
